=== The laptop comes back ===
One deletion was refused because a machine is still bound to the leaver. In a real
estate this is where \`jml device dispose --disposition return_to_pool\` runs, which
unbinds the machine only after an uninstall receipt. The demo unbinds it directly:
the fake providers have no command channel to fire a script down.

unbind sys-demo-laptop from Robin Ellis: ok=true verified=true

=== The deletion day, again  (2026-01-22) ===
Same day, same run, nothing else changed. The gate reads the provider live rather than
trusting what it recorded last time, so the deletion now proceeds.


